{"id":51060,"shortDescription":"Entra en el mundo de Drawn y desvela los secretos de la Torre Pintada. Supera puzles desafiantes en tu misión por salvar a Iris. Una maldición ha sellado cada nivel de la torre y sólo el más creativo de los aventureros podrá encontrar la salida. Entra en exuberantes mundos pintados y conoce a fantásticos personajes que te ayudarán...","developers":["Big Fish Studios"],"publishers":["BFG Entertainment"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Cromos de Steam","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"19 ENE 2011","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/51060?t=1764599576","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51060/ss_93548fb8a097b579fb6e25581587345d7a7ac90e.600x338.jpg?t=1764599576","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51060/ss_93548fb8a097b579fb6e25581587345d7a7ac90e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764599576"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51060/ss_6045adde4b5f6344aeaf8dfcff98bce42273515d.600x338.jpg?t=1764599576","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51060/ss_6045adde4b5f6344aeaf8dfcff98bce42273515d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764599576"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51060/ss_bffbfb5b0cf1c43eeef18545a45e62d7302a69ad.600x338.jpg?t=1764599576","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51060/ss_bffbfb5b0cf1c43eeef18545a45e62d7302a69ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764599576"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51060/ss_567cf36f8c9c049faccd59780a82aebe16bbb8ff.600x338.jpg?t=1764599576","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51060/ss_567cf36f8c9c049faccd59780a82aebe16bbb8ff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764599576"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/51060/ss_3410db0f68dd6d1a